  "body": "An issue to track the adding ServiceWorker support to WebBluetooth.\r\n\r\nThings to think about:\r\n\r\n - Could/Should this allow persistent connections to devices e.g. a User initiates connection to a device on phone/laptop, the bluetoothDevice object is passed to the ServiceWorker. The phone/laptop goes out of range, comes back later, can the ServiceWorker reconnect in the background? \r\n -Should it ask permission again every time or just once with option to allow again until revoked?",
